{"spec": "ACP v1 Requesting permission (session/request_permission; options optionId, kind allow_once/allow_always/reject_once/reject_always; outcome selected with optionId, or cancelled) (https://agentclientprotocol.com/protocol/prompt-turn; schema v1 RequestPermissionRequest, PermissionOptionKind). rvim rule: the connector never answers a request by itself; only a PermissionAnswer event (a key) does. Two requests are answered in order."}
{"event": "connect", "cwd": "/home/user/project", "at": 0, "expect": [{"send": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "method": "initialize", "params": {"protocolVersion": 1, "clientCapabilities": {"fs": {"readTextFile": false, "writeTextFile": false}, "terminal": false}, "clientInfo": {"name": "rvim", "version": "<any>"}}}}], "state": "Initializing"}
{"event": "bytes", "at": 5, "in": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "result": {"protocolVersion": 1, "agentCapabilities": {}, "authMethods": []}}, "expect": [{"send": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "method": "session/new", "params": {"cwd": "/home/user/project", "mcpServers": []}}}], "state": "Initializing"}
{"event": "bytes", "at": 10, "in": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "result": {"sessionId": "sess_abc123"}}, "expect": [{"notice": "connected", "session": "sess_abc123"}], "state": "Ready"}
{"event": "prompt", "at": 20, "text": "Edit two files", "expect": [{"send": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "method": "session/prompt", "params": {"sessionId": "sess_abc123", "prompt": [{"type": "text", "text": "Edit two files"}]}}}, {"notice": "turn_started", "turn": 1}], "state": "Prompting"}
{"event": "bytes", "at": 30, "in": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 100, "method": "session/request_permission", "params": {"sessionId": "sess_abc123", "toolCall": {"toolCallId": "call_a", "title": "Write src/a.rs", "kind": "edit", "status": "pending"}, "options": [{"optionId": "allow", "name": "Allow", "kind": "allow_once"}, {"optionId": "always", "name": "Always", "kind": "allow_always"}, {"optionId": "reject", "name": "Reject", "kind": "reject_once"}]}}, "expect": [{"ask_permission": {"tool": "Write src/a.rs", "options": ["allow", "always", "reject"], "queued": 1}}], "state": "Prompting"}
{"event": "bytes", "at": 31, "in": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 101, "method": "session/request_permission", "params": {"sessionId": "sess_abc123", "toolCall": {"toolCallId": "call_b", "title": "Read src/b.rs", "kind": "read", "status": "pending"}, "options": [{"optionId": "allow", "name": "Allow", "kind": "allow_once"}, {"optionId": "reject", "name": "Reject", "kind": "reject_once"}]}}, "expect": [{"ask_permission": {"tool": "Write src/a.rs", "options": ["allow", "always", "reject"], "queued": 2}}], "state": "Prompting"}
{"event": "tick", "at": 600000, "expect": [], "state": "Prompting"}
{"event": "answer", "at": 600001, "select": "allow", "expect": [{"send": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 100, "result": {"outcome": {"outcome": "selected", "optionId": "allow"}}}}, {"ask_permission": {"tool": "Read src/b.rs", "options": ["allow", "reject"], "queued": 1}}], "state": "Prompting"}
{"event": "answer", "at": 600002, "select": "reject", "expect": [{"send": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 101, "result": {"outcome": {"outcome": "selected", "optionId": "reject"}}}}], "state": "Prompting"}
{"event": "answer", "at": 600003, "select": "allow", "expect": [], "state": "Prompting"}
{"event": "bytes", "at": 600010, "in": {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "result": {"stopReason": "end_turn"}}, "expect": [{"notice": "turn_ended", "turn": 1, "stop": "end_turn"}], "state": "Ready"}
